  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mali Business Support Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Mali Business Support programme builds on the successful programmes Fonds d&#x2019;appui &#xe0; la cr&#xe9;ation d&#x2019;entreprise par les jeunes (FACEJ) and Enhancement of Framework Conditions for Entrepreneurship (EPEC) currently ongoing in Mali and funded by the Danish Embassy and the Netherlands Embassy in Bamako. The Mali Business Support Network programme aims to increase the impact of these programmes through a bespoke individual support programme for the hundred most promising entrepreneurs currently participating in FACEJ and EPEC. By helping the most promising entrepreneurs to become investment-ready and helping them reach their next level of development, the ultimate goal of this programme is to increase job opportunities for Malian youth and improve the enabling environment for young Malian entrepreneurs.</narrative>
  </description>
